  "title": "Gratitude in the Face of Pandemic",
  "summary": "American scholar and anthropologist, Loren Eiseley once said “If there is magic on this planet, it is contained in water.” Historically, water has been symbolic of countless beliefs but scientifically, we know that without water there is no life. For 123 years, Middlesex Water Company (MWC) has been a trusted supplier of water utility services. ... <a title=\"Gratitude in the Face of Pandemic\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://www.middlesexwater.com/gratitude-in-the-face-of-pandemic/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Gratitude in the Face of Pandemic\">Read more</a>",
